次发布的《意见》部署了 6 个方面 18 项主要任务。 一是强化人工智能的就业创造效应。拓展新兴领域人工智能就业新空间，培育中小微企业稳岗扩岗新动能，创造人工智能领域就业创业新模式，加快开发人工智能领域新职业。 二是构建就业友好型人工智能升级路径。挖掘传统领域人工智能就业潜能，减缓人工智能应用就业替代影响，建立人工智能应用就业风险评估机制。 三是提升劳动者数字素养和就业能力。协同培养人工智能创新型人才，实施人工智能专项培训计划。 四是推动人工智能赋能高品质就业政策服务。运用人工智能助力就业政策落实，提高就业服务智能化水平，加大转型转岗就业支持力度。 五是健全劳动者权益保障制度和社会保障制度。优化适应人机协同的劳动者权益保障制度","heat":"640 万热度","video":false,"rank":1,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960402,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"ITHOME","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/017/345.htm","title":"史诗级更新：微信远程升级支持在 iPhone Duo 上和其他设备同时登录","snippet":"","heat":"日榜 #1","video":false,"rank":1,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867962932,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"HUPU","url":"https://bbs.hupu.com/643193856.html","title":"咱们跟土耳其这是咋了？","snippet":"","heat":"","video":false,"rank":1,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867961511,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"BAIDU","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%87%91%E6%AD%A3%E6%81%A9%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E4%B8%B9%E4%B8%9C&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","title":"金正恩访问丹东","snippet":"","heat":"7808298 热搜指数","video":false,"rank":1,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867963262,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"CLS","url":"https://api3.cls.cn/share/article/2513857?os=android&sv=835","title":"国常会：要加快建设生育友好型社会","snippet":"","heat":"749275 阅读","video":false,"rank":1,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867962911,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"V2EX",