estion/2097252062257832354","title":"宇树机器人侧空翻表演时甩断腿，问题可能出在哪里？出现这种情况正常吗？","snippet":"10 月 22 日，宇树科技「2026 世界物理 AI 大会暨宇树合作伙伴生态大会」现场，一段机器人侧空翻失误的视频引发热议。 画面中，一台白色人形机器人正在进行功夫动作演示，尝试侧空翻落地时失去平衡，侧摔在地，一条机械小腿从连接处脱落，掉落在一旁的黑色地垫上。 据悉，发生意外的机器人为宇树科技 10 月 21 日刚刚发布的 H2-X 人形机器人，官方命名为「H2-X 功夫传奇 守护」。官方宣传视频展示了该机器人踢凹汽车车门、徒手抬起汽车，以及从约 4 米高台跃下完成空翻等动作，主打安保与应急救援场景，最长续航约 8 小时。 截至目前，宇树科技未对「机器人甩断腿」进行说明。 宇树 H2-X 功夫传奇机器人侧空翻表演甩断腿 ，前一天刚正式发布，可徒手抬汽车还能当「私人保镖」_ 腾讯新闻","heat":"91 万热度","video":false,"rank":10,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960402,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"TIEBA","url":"https://tieba.baidu.com/hottopic/browse/hottopic?topic_id=28368002&topic_name=%E7%93%A6%E5%AD%A6%E5%BC%9F%E5%BC%80%E5%9B%A2%E6%92%B8%E5%8F%8B%2C%E6%8A%97%E5%90%A7%E8%AE%A4%E6%A0%BD","title":"瓦学弟开团撸友,抗吧认栽","snippet":"LPL瑞士轮首战全败，撸友遭CN瓦观众嘲讽。抗吧认栽：成绩不好只能受着。","heat":"303500 讨论","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":1792830619000,"observedAt":1792867964370,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"HUPU","url":"https://bbs.hupu.com/643170746.html","title":"法国骚乱暴露的歪理：中国人吃好喝好开名车，就理所应当去抢？","snippet":"","heat":"","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867961511,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"V2EX","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251413#reply18","title":"做匿名举报系统，难的不是表单，而是权限模型与动态隔离","snippet":"","heat":"最热","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867963226,"sourceTag":"node:promotions","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"THEPAPER","url":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34325090","title":"广西多地呼吁“外嫁女回娘家”摒弃攀比","snippet":"","heat":"热榜 #11","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":1792833355541,"observedAt":1792867963171,"sourceTag":"中国政库","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"ITHOME","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/017/397.htm","title":"中国联通：已在苹果直营店 / 授权店安排千余名驻店员，协助 iPhone Duo 购机用户现场开通 eSIM","snippet":"","heat":"日榜 #11","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867962932,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"WEIBO","url":"https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%E6%9B%9D%E5%88%98%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%89%E5%BC%A0%E4%BA%88%E6%9B%A6%E5%B7%AE%E7%82%B9%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A","title":"曝刘学义张予曦差点结婚","snippet":"","heat":"118051","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960900,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"ZHIHU","url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2096550287901307789","title":"你怎么看毛不易在女性好友婚礼上的致辞，算越界吗？为什么「结婚越来越不意味着什么」引发热议？","snippet":"近日，毛不易现身相识二十余年的发小佳奇的婚礼并登台致辞。短短三分钟的发言，没有华丽空洞的客套套话，仅凭低谷时期「班长做饭」等温暖真挚的过往往事，以及通透治愈的婚姻观，打动了无数网友，令众人动容落泪。现场，毛不易还温情演唱了歌曲《岁月里的花》，为新人送上专属祝福。 致辞中，毛不易细数了自己与佳奇跨越多年的深厚情谊：「我们才三十出头，却已相伴二十多年。人生路上，大多数朋友只会陪我们走过短短一程，唯有佳奇，是与我交集最深的挚友。从初高中相伴、大学同行，到一同北漂打拼，岁岁年年，我们始终亲密相依、彼此陪伴。」 他坦言，自己完整见证了好友的成长与蜕变：「从校服到婚纱，我全程见证了她的成长与蜕变，我们彼此陪伴、互为人生见证。如今，婚姻早已不是人生的必答题，但我始终相信，结婚，是人生一场崭新且美好的开端。」 这段真诚质朴的婚礼致辞走红后，引发全网热议。不少网友深受触动，表示：「互相见证了彼此二十年的成长与变化，早已超越普通朋友，胜似亲人。很容易代入自己，看着最好的朋友步入人生新阶段，满心欣喜又万般感慨，真心祝福新人。」 与此同时，也有部分网友提出争议观点，认为二人是异性挚友，此番深情致辞放在婚礼现场，并不合适。","heat":"86 万热度","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960402,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"BAIDU","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87%E8%BA%B2%E2%80%9C%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%89%E8%A7%92%E2%80%9D%E9%81%BF%E9%99%A9%E4%B8%8D%E9%9D%A0%E8%B0%B1&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","title":"地震躲“生命三角”避险不靠谱","snippet":"","heat":"6853589 热搜指数","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867963262,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"CLS","url":"https://api3.cls.cn/share/article/2514203?os=android&sv=835","title":"OpenAI、Anthropic齐参与！全球首个AI生物安全实验室将问世","snippet":"","heat":"285236 阅读","video":false,"rank":11,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867962911,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"V2EX","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251436#reply18","title":"Pro 已掉，羊毛没了🤣","snippet":"","heat":"最热","video":false,"rank":12,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867963226,"sourceTag":"node:programmer","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"ZHIHU","url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2093004562508601270","title":"7000 名玩家票选最烂画面效果，动态模糊以 80% 得票率夺冠，为什么这个技术现在如此令人讨厌？","snippet":"PC Gamer 近日办了一场游戏图形效果淘汰赛，让玩家投票选出最令人讨厌的画面效果。整场赛事约 7000 人参与，单决赛就收到近 2000 份投票：动态模糊以 80% 对 20% 的压倒性优势击败色差，被正式确认为游戏里最糟糕的图形效果。编辑 Jacob Ridley 在文章里写道，我们终于可以以近乎科学的确定性宣布，动态模糊是最烂的，而且是以绝对压倒性的优势。 不过文章也给了动态模糊一些公道话：在低帧率场景——尤其是主机平台上——以及赛车游戏等特定类型中，适度使用确实有价值，它本质上是一种掩盖画面瑕疵的手段。而且对 PC 玩家来说，动态模糊通常是可选设置，能在菜单里关掉。 真正的问题在于它往往默认开启，又不会在性能达标时自动关闭。PC Gamer 编辑描述了自己的习惯：每次启动游戏，第一件事就是进设置菜单关掉动态模糊，这已经成了肌肉记忆，像刷牙一样根深蒂固。文章最后写道，只要开发者继续默认开启，玩家就会继续关掉它，如此循环往复，直到我们全部消亡。","heat":"81 万热度","video":false,"rank":12,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960402,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},{"source":"HUPU","url":"https://bbs.hupu.com/643159365.html","title":"一女生校内找男朋友的要求，JR们看看过分吗？","snippet":"","heat":"","video":false,"rank":12,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867961511,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"}],"developerProfile":[{"id":"developer-tech-positive","scope":"sample","action":"MORE","sample":"软件开发、程序员的技术实践、开源工具、电脑和手机硬件的实际使用体验"},{"id":"developer-entertainment-negative","scope":"sample","action":"LESS","sample":"娱乐明星的恋情、绯闻、粉丝之间的争吵"}],"fixtureRevision":2,"derivation":{"originalSha256":"e6fc0bbb2c214aebd06cc447322dd854a8afdfcde40439cad721215d761c19c9","replacementCorpusSha256":"d84ae4f42e3c7d390db97999438ff985b5feee27340114d3251bcba99ba031a7","replacedIndex":85,"removed":{"source":"WEIBO","url":"https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%E5%BE%90%E5%98%89%E4%BD%9950%E7%B1%B3%E4%BB%B0%E6%B3%B3%E7%A0%B4%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95","title":"徐嘉余50米仰泳破世界纪录","snippet":"","heat":"118079","video":false,"rank":10,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960900,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"},"inserted":{"source":"WEIBO","url":"https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%E8%BF%AA%E4%B8%BD%E7%83%AD%E5%B7%B4%E8%9D%B4%E8%9D%B6%E9%A3%9E%E8%B5%B0%E6%98%AF%E5%B7%A7%E5%90%88","title":"迪丽热巴蝴蝶飞走是巧合","snippet":"","heat":"118036","video":false,"rank":12,"publishedAt":null,"observedAt":1792867960900,"sourceTag":"","bodyLanguage":"UNKNOWN","bodyLanguageAt":0,"videoEvidenceAt":0,"metadataLanguage":"CHINESE","languagePolicy":"zh-metadata-v1"}}}